{"name":"10-4-1N","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"2","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"10256","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-7","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gager","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So it seems that you aren't much of an elite after all — you're nothing compared to the Griffin Dolls I've fought before. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By now, it should be crystal clear to you just how much better I am in terms of performance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"98k slings her rifle back onto her shoulder and comes out into the open with her arms in the air."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kar98k","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But you're also nothing compared to the Sangvis units that I've fought."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-7","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gager","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph, still talking big even while you're in such a predicament?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-7","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kar98k","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have probably also located me when you locked onto my Dummies... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why didn't you destroy me along with them?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-7","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"